<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00511">
	<title>Blind-Spot Collision-Avoidance Assist operation</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>blind-spot collision-avoidance assist (BCA)
					<indexterm>operation</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>Blind-Spot Collision-Avoidance Assist operates as follows:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>Collision Warning (while driving)</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Collision-Avoidance Assist (while departing)</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
